    </div>

    <div class="scenario" id="t15">
        <div class="scenario-head"><span class="id">T15</span><h3>Correct a posted bill</h3></div>
        <div class="facts"><span><b>Role:</b> Accountant</span><span><b>Menu:</b> Operations ▸ Vendor Bills</span><span><b>Time:</b> 5 min</span></div>
        <p>Checking the paperwork, you see the plumber's bill was 950, not 850.</p>
        <ol class="steps">
            <li>On bill QF-118 select <span class="btn">Reset</span>. The journal leaves the accounts and the bill becomes editable.</li>
            <li>Edit the line price to 950 and save.</li>
